{"h":3395,"lines":[{"c":1,"y":0.10273548820282818,"h":0.015459256121632015,"x":0.12539910788310521,"w":0.11339931488037111,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"w":0.69547322591145833,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.12962964207750918,"y":0.14534883708965218,"t":"There was also an additional initiative that had not been originally planned, but which became"},{"h":0.016554383141974882,"t":"a central feature of the programme. This was when farmers started to dig holes for tanks in","x":0.12953830641414432,"y":0.15777849201701832,"w":0.67508722941080734,"c":1},{"x":0.12962963392641286,"w":0.69341562906901033,"t":"the fenced-off areas and to fill these with water and use them for breeding fish - an important","h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.1743227327421546,"c":1},{"y":0.18895348825197433,"x":0.12962962044954851,"c":1,"t":"source of protein. After a time, another suggestion was made by local people which hadn't","h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.67078191121419273},{"y":0.20133538609943669,"h":0.016646991770174813,"c":1,"t":"been part of the programme's original proposal, but which was also adopted later on. They","x":0.12955805259553282,"w":0.67296834309895837},{"w":0.65226338704427078,"c":1,"t":"decided to try setting up colonies of bees, which would provide honey both for their own","y":0.21790341567638638,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.12962962324288962},{"t":"consumption and to sell.","w":0.18350934346516928,"x":0.12939478992844794,"y":0.23113291054990803,"c":1,"h":0.015361948765910904},{"y":0.25150921049117869,"w":0.64421635945638023,"h":0.015969621278652868,"x":0.12955061659464454,"t":"So what lessons can be learned from this programme? First of all, it tells us that in dry,","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.12962963863178772,"t":"arid regions, if there is access to a reliable source of water, there is great potential for the","y":0.26884570092688165,"w":0.66255142211914064,"h":0.013250883392226243},{"c":1,"w":0.69763427734375005,"h":0.016906778158091273,"y":0.28182999117394125,"t":"development of agriculture. In Chicualacuala, there was a marked improvement in agricultural","x":0.12958945355440987},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"production, which improved food security and benefited local people by providing them with","x":0.12757202251390501,"y":0.29651162763101269,"c":1,"w":0.68106994628906248},{"c":1,"t":"both food and income. However, it's important to set realistic timelines for each phase of the","y":0.31096605646278153,"w":0.68321044921875007,"x":0.12958959068197012,"h":0.013843579623668334},{"h":0.015836299518814378,"t":"programme, especially for its design, as mistakes made at this stage may be hard to correct","x":0.12956298077331355,"y":0.32457721785349447,"w":0.70795705159505207,"c":1},{"x":0.12729065547577448,"c":1,"h":0.010557935712475208,"w":0.066427618662516286,"y":0.34190938043317654,"t":"later on."},{"w":0.67087036132812505,"y":0.36145971100331398,"h":0.014911322486976242,"t":"The programme demonstrates that sustainable development is possible in areas where ...","c":1,"x":0.12957968029163036},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.85802469153672367,"y":0.17296511611791132,"w":0.032921810150146502,"t":"Q38","c":1},{"w":0.032921810150146502,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q39","y":0.2165697672807021,"x":0.85802469153672367,"c":1},{"t":"Q40","x":0.84362139948615544,"y":0.3241279068319376,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.049382715225219753},{"y":0.92005813937645065,"w":0.03497942288716635,"t":"106","x":0.12962963001089212,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1}],"w":2400}